WEBVTT

NOTE
An Esthar sorceress-power apparatus — a sorceress figure within a golden energy ring.
Duration: approximately 26 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
A great golden ring of rotating energy panels blazes in an Esthar chamber.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.040
A robed sorceress figure rises within it.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:19.150
Two onlookers watch, one a lab-coated scientist.
